  "statement": {
    "content": "من الكتاب (ص 39): حلّل باستعمال $a^2 - b^2 = (a + b)(a - b)$ : $A = (3 - 2x)^2 - 9$ ، $B = \\dfrac{1}{4} - \\left(x + \\dfrac{3}{2}\\right)^2$ ، $C = (x + 2)^2 - (3x - 1)^2$ ."
  },
  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "statement": "حلّل A.",
      "learningPoints": [
        {
          "code": "4am_tahlil-ibara_P3",
          "role": "primary"
        }
      ],
      "answerType": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "content": "$-2x(6 - 2x)$",
          "isCorrect": true
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "content": "$(-6 - 2x)(12 - 2x)$",
          "isCorrect": false,
          "misconceptionId": "MISC-MUTATABIQA-MURABBA-MUAMIL"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "content": "$(-2x)^2$",
          "isCorrect": false,
          "misconceptionId": "MISC-TAHLIL-FARQ-MURABBA"
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        {
          "id": "h1",
          "type": "look",
          "content": "$9 = 3^2$."
        },
        {
          "id": "h2",
          "type": "direction",
          "content": "$a = 3 - 2x$ و $b = 3$."
        },
        {
          "id": "h3",
          "type": "strategy",
          "content": "اكتب $(a - b)(a + b)$ ثم بسّط كل قوس."
        }
      ],
      "feedback": {
        "correct": "$A = (3 - 2x - 3)(3 - 2x + 3) = -2x(6 - 2x)$.",
        "incorrect": "$b$ هو جذر 9، أي 3."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "statement": "حلّل B.",
      "learningPoints": [
        {
          "code": "4am_tahlil-ibara_P3",
          "role": "primary"
        }
      ],
      "answerType": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "content": "$(2 - x)(x + 2)$",
          "isCorrect": false,
          "misconceptionId": "MISC-TAHLIL-ISHARA-QAWS"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "content": "$(-x - 1)(x + 2)$",
          "isCorrect": true
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "content": "$\\left(\\dfrac{1}{4} - x - \\dfrac{3}{2}\\right)\\left(\\dfrac{1}{4} + x + \\dfrac{3}{2}\\right)$",
          "isCorrect": false,
          "misconceptionId": "MISC-MUTATABIQA-MURABBA-MUAMIL"
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        {
          "id": "h1",
          "type": "look",
          "content": "$\\dfrac{1}{4} = \\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^2$."
        },
        {
          "id": "h2",
          "type": "direction",
          "content": "$a = \\dfrac{1}{2}$ و $b = x + \\dfrac{3}{2}$."
        },
        {
          "id": "h3",
          "type": "strategy",
          "content": "ضع $b$ بين قوسين قبل الطرح."
        }
      ],
      "feedback": {
        "correct": "$B = \\left(\\dfrac{1}{2} - x - \\dfrac{3}{2}\\right)\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2} + x + \\dfrac{3}{2}\\right) = (-x - 1)(x + 2)$.",
        "incorrect": "$a$ هو جذر $\\dfrac{1}{4}$ ، و $-b = -x - \\dfrac{3}{2}$."
      }
    },
    {
